{
  "text": "Your first time will not look like what you've seen on a screen — and that's good news. This is number six of the seven things nobody tells you; follow so you don't miss number one, it's the big one. Six: there'll be pauses. Something will be awkward. Somebody might laugh. That's not it going wrong — that's what real looks like. The guys who panic are the ones expecting a performance. So walk in expecting real, not a highlight reel. Hold onto this: awkward is normal, and it passes. Number five next — it's the one that takes all the pressure off you.",
